Arhitectura
-----------
Haswell (coada haswell):
  - CPU: Intel Xeon E5-26xx v3, arhitectura Haswell, AVX2
  - Cache: L1d 32KB, L2 256KB, L3 25MB (detalii in lscpu pe nod)
  - Compilator: gcc 7.x (din container optimizari.sif), -O2
  - BLAS: OpenBLAS (din container)

